<blockquote class="note">
  <p>This source reproduces the legacy V3 <a href="/delphi-epidata/api/fluview.html"><code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">fluview</code></a> endpoint. Age breakdowns are now queried using the <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">age_group</code> column, and signal names follow standard V5 conventions. See <a href="#relationship-to-v3">Relationship to V3</a>.</p>
</blockquote>
<h2 class="no_toc text-delta" id="table-of-contents">
  
  
